# Page boundaries of a 2-row window over 3 items, both directions.
S START
# PgUp at the top stays on the first row.
K PGUP
S TOPUP
# PgDn: the window ends on the last row, which is selected.
K PGDN
S PGDN1
# PgDn at the bottom stays.
K PGDN
S PGDN2
# PgUp goes back to the first row.
K PGUP
S PGUP1
K PGUP
S PGUP2
# Down past the window's last row scrolls it by one row.
K DOWN
S DOWN1
K DOWN
S DOWN2
# Down at the last row stays.
K DOWN
S DOWN3
# Up back over the boundary and past the first row.
K UP
S UP1
K UP
S UP2
K UP
S UP3
# Home and End, with SHIFT and CTRL held, move as without; PgDn with
# CTRL is the owner's key (KEY 34 0 1), and moves nothing.
K END
S END1
K HOME
S HOME1
K CTRL-END
S CEND1
K SHIFT-HOME
S SHOME1
K CTRL-PGDN
S CPGDN1
K PGDN SHIFT-PGUP
S SPGUP1
K SHIFT-DOWN
S SDOWN1
